{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はもっと気持ちを引き締め\n頑張っていきたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに変わったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思っていただけるようなそんな年にしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も沢山の乃木坂familyさん達に逢えますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は私の大好きなかずみん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんfamilyの皆様宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個握も、スッゴク楽しみにしてます♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いので暖かくして来て下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も風邪ひかないように皆を待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握は元気な感じの服か、\n女の子らしい服にするかまよってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちがいいと思いますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/3855931/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}